#, js-format
msgid "Adjusted word rate (%s)"
msgstr ""

#. translators: Tooltip next to the adjusted word rate row in the cost table. "Legacy" means the older engines, as opposed to WPML's own.
msgid "This adjusted word rate applies to legacy translation engines."
msgstr ""

