msgid "Switch to PTC"
msgstr ""

#. translators: Note under the word-count table; "This" is the total above it and "It" is that same total.
msgid "This is what translating your current content needs today. It does not include some texts added by other plugins, such as forms or sliders, which are counted after setup is complete. Site strings from your theme and plugins are also counted after setup and typically add several hundred words. Future updates are charged only for the words you add or change."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Note under the word-count table; "This" is the total above it and "It" is that same total.
msgid "This is what translating your current content needs today. It does not include some texts added by other plugins, such as forms or sliders, which are counted after setup is complete. Site strings from your theme and plugins are also counted after setup and typically add several hundred words. Pay once per page — edited words are charged again when you change a page."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Note under the word-count table; "This" is the total above it.
msgid "This is what translating your current content needs today. Future updates are charged only for the words you add or change."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Note under the word-count table; "This" is the total above it.
msgid "This is what translating your current content needs today. Pay once per page — edited words are charged again when you change a page."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Label under the running total in the word-count table; the number is written above it.
msgid "Total items"
msgstr ""

msgid "Total source words"
msgstr ""

#. translators: Used on WPML's paged lists for the control that goes back one page: the visible button label, and the accessible label (screen readers) of the back arrow.
